<Base title="Privacy Policy" description="How On Simplicity handles information when you browse the journal and Resource Partners directory." breadcrumbs={[{name:'Home',path:'/'},{name:'Privacy Policy'}]}><header class="page-header"><p class="eyebrow">The details</p><h1>Privacy Policy</h1><p>Effective November 21, 2026</p></header><article class="prose prose-stone max-w-none reading-width"><h2>Browsing this publication</h2><p>On Simplicity provides articles and a directory of independent businesses. You do not need an account to read this site. This site does not ask you to enter payment details or create a personal profile.</p><h2>Technical information</h2><p>Our hosting provider may process technical information such as IP addresses, requested pages, browser details and request timestamps to deliver pages, maintain security and investigate errors. This information is handled under the provider’s policies and applicable law. The site does not currently include advertising trackers or a separate analytics script.</p><h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>If you contact the publication by email, the information you provide may be used to respond, investigate a correction or update directory information. Do not include sensitive information. We do not sell contact messages or use them to create advertising profiles.</p><h2>External images, maps and links</h2><p>Resource Partners articles may display images hosted by other websites. Opening a business profile that includes a Google Maps embed connects your browser to Google, which may receive your IP address and use cookies under its own policies. Business websites and other external links operate independently and have their own privacy practices. We do not control their collection or use of information.</p><h2>Your choices and requests</h2><p>You can manage cookies and other storage through your browser settings. For a question about information you have shared with this publication or an applicable privacy right, visit our <a href="/contact/">contact page</a>. We may need information to verify and respond to a request. This policy will be updated if the site’s data practices change.</p></article></Base>
